  "body": " * git: Clone submodules whose URL is scp-like (`git@example.com:team/lib.git`) or starts with `ssh://`, using `git+ssh`.\n * Read chunked HTTP responses to their end before reusing the connection. This fixes `brz push` of large git branches, mostly over HTTPS.\n * Do not resend a request whose body came from an already consumed iterator or file; a push sent an empty pack.\n * gitlab: Accept numeric project ids.\n * git: Ignore peeled `^{}` lines in `info/refs` over dumb HTTP. Branching a repository with an annotated tag failed with `RefFormatError`.\n * `workspace.check_clean_tree` no longer hashes files inside `.gitignore`'d directories on git working trees.\n",
